<title>AUSTRALIA: Henry Walker half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>Henry Walker half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    15.16 vs 15.85</p>
<p>    Net				     10.81 vs 9.45</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     4.75 vs 3.75</p>
<p>NOTE: Henry Walker Group Ltd is a contract miner and transport services firm.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  253.65 vs 195.81</p>
<p>    Other income			   4.49 vs 4.04</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.91 vs 9.12</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 31</p>
<p>Reg date March 21</p>
<p>    Tax					4.30 vs 5.94</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.16 vs 2.12</p>
<p>Depreciation 12.89 vs 11.93</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
